/*
 * ROOTERY - Smart Hydroponics Controller v2.0
 * ESP32 + Supabase
 *
 * PINOUT
 * Pump Relay         GPIO 26  (Main water pump, active LOW)
 * Sprinkler Relay    GPIO 27  (Sprinkler, active LOW)
 * Pump Button        GPIO 32  (INPUT_PULLUP)
 * Sprinkler Button   GPIO 33  (INPUT_PULLUP)
 * Reset Button       GPIO 25  (INPUT_PULLUP)
 * pH Sensor          GPIO 34  (ADC) — NOT READ, manufactured data
 * TDS Sensor         GPIO 35  (ADC) — NOT READ, manufactured data
 * DS18B20            GPIO 4   (OneWire, water temp) — NOT READ, manufactured data
 * DHT22              GPIO 15  (Air temp + humidity) — REAL
 * Ultrasonic 1 TRIG  GPIO 19  (Main tank - water pump) — REAL
 * Ultrasonic 1 ECHO  GPIO 23                            — REAL
 * Ultrasonic 2 TRIG  GPIO 13  (Sprinkler tank) — REAL
 * Ultrasonic 2 ECHO  GPIO 14                   — REAL
 * LCD SDA            GPIO 5
 * LCD SCL            GPIO 18
 *
 * SENSOR STRATEGY
 *  - DHT22 air temp + humidity : real hardware read
 *  - Ultrasonic 1 & 2          : real hardware read
 *  - Water temp (DS18B20)      : smooth manufactured data
 *  - pH, TDS                   : smooth manufactured data
 */

